[statement]
A package installed for its `install_if` follows the package that completes
its condition, not its place in the order of names: `zz-extra` follows
`a`, before `zz`.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:zz-extra
V:1
i:a

P:zz
V:1

[request]
zz
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install zz-extra 1
install zz 1
